WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.633
I'm back.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.179
What's the matter?

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.604
"I have Rilakkuma.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.857
If you want him back,

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:27.819
I'll exchange him for three pancakes.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:32.782
Meet me in front
of the apartment building at 7:00 p.m.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:36.453
Don't forget to put
butter and honey on them."

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.957
Kidnapped?

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.839
Kidnapped?

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:06.149
I must save him!
I must save him right now!

00:01:08.651 --> 00:01:09.736
Not this!

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:16.993
Not this either!

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:17.994
PANCAKE MIX

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.330
Oh, right. Pancakes.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.375
Come on. What's wrong with me?

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:26.544
Oh, the eggs!

00:01:28.838 --> 00:01:30.256
Come on!

00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:52.862
ROOM 102

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.256
Yo. I've been waiting for you.

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:16.886
Man, they're burnt.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.723
Well, whatever.

00:02:30.108 --> 00:02:31.151
It's yummy!

00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:35.572
Do you have any idea
how worried I was?

00:02:36.573 --> 00:02:38.074
Let's go! Now!

00:02:41.452 --> 00:02:43.580
Hey, wait!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.418
Please don't approach my bear again.

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:51.087
Wait! I said wait!

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:57.677
Please stay until I finish eating.

00:03:06.769 --> 00:03:08.938
Where's your mom?

00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:13.860
She'll be back late today.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.531
And your dad?

